      hu: ["L\\u00edbiai \\u0151slakos m\\u0171v\\u00e9szetet mutat be.", "Egy kis barlangba faragt\\u00e1k.", "Emberi \\u00e9s \\u00e1llati arcokat \\u00e1br\\u00e1zol."],
      ro: ["Folose\\u0219te art\\u0103 indigen\\u0103 libian\\u0103.", "Sculptat \\u00eentr-o pe\\u0219ter\\u0103 mic\\u0103.", "Prezint\\u0103 fe\\u021be umane \\u0219i de animale."],
      en: ["Features Libyan indigenous art.", "Carved into a small cave.", "Depicts human and animal faces."]
