      hu: ["Kor\\u00e1bban Theodoriasnak h\\u00edvt\\u00e1k.", "50 mozaikpanelt tal\\u00e1ltak.", "A pharoszi vil\\u00e1g\\u00edt\\u00f3tornyot \\u00e1br\\u00e1zolja."],
      ro: ["Cunoscut anterior ca Theodorias.", "S-au g\\u0103sit 50 de panouri de mozaic.", "Arat\\u0103 farul din Pharos."],
